2019-01-01 open Income:Salary CAD

2019-02-01 * "before the second open"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 CAD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 CAD

2019-03-01 open Income:Salary USD

2019-04-01 * "after the second open"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 CAD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 CAD
